# .aiexclude - Configuration for AI Coding Agents\n# This file defines patterns that AI agents should ignore when analyzing the codebase.\n# Excluding these helps focus the agent on relevant source code and reduces noise.\n\n# Assets and media (large binary files, not readable as text)\nassets/*\n\n# Build outputs and dependency management files\nbuild/*\n.dart_tool/*\n\n# Platform-specific project files (Android, iOS, Web, Desktop)\n# Usually contains boilerplate and native code not relevant for general Flutter logic.\nandroid/*\nios/*\nweb/*\nwindows/*\nmacos/*\nlinux/*\n\n# IDE-specific settings (IntelliJ/Android Studio)\n.idea/*
